    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_02",
      "hash64": "FD55985EBA6B173A",
      "text": "Oh. Hola, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_03",
      "hash64": "FD55995EBA6B18ED",
      "text": "Estaba tan absorto en mis pensamientos que ni\\nte he oído acercarte.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_04",
      "hash64": "FD55925EBA6B0D08",
      "text": "Te debo una disculpa por lo acaecido en el\\nárea recreativa.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "919C6BF04B41CC5E",
      "text": "No es necesario",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "919C6AF04B41CAAB",
      "text": "¿A qué se refiere?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_05a",
      "hash64": "E37843F6C3EA3C6E",
      "text": "Ja, ja... Vuelves a hacer gala de una madurez\\ninusitada.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_05b",
      "hash64": "E37842F6C3EA3ABB",
      "text": "A que tuviera que marcharme de improviso en\\nplena conversación.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_06",
      "hash64": "FD55945EBA6B106E",
      "text": "Verás, la Domadragón que nos interrumpió es\\nen realidad pariente mía.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_08",
      "hash64": "FD558E5EBA6B063C",
      "text": "La cría y entreno de Pokémon dragón se remonta\\nvarias generaciones en mi familia.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_09",
      "hash64": "FD558F5EBA6B07EF",
      "text": "Desde bien pequeño se me educó para ser el\\nfuturo cabeza del clan.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_10",
      "hash64": "FD591C5EBA6E2D5D",
      "text": "No obstante, durante mi etapa de adolescente\\nrebelde, que tuve aunque cueste creerlo...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_11",
      "hash64": "FD591B5EBA6E2BAA",
      "text": "Me fugué de casa profiriendo a los cuatro\\nvientos que viviría de la música.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_12",
      "hash64": "FD591A5EBA6E29F7",
      "text": "Una cosa llevó a la otra y, tras varias peripecias,\\nacabé ejerciendo como profesor de Arte...\\r\\ny miembro del Alto Mando, claro está.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_13",
      "hash64": "FD59195EBA6E2844",
      "text": "Después de retirarnos a conversar, mi pariente\\ninsistió en que abandonara la docencia y me\\r\\nvolcara de pleno en mi papel de patriarca.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_14",
      "hash64": "FD59185EBA6E2691",
      "text": "Según parece, la salud del patriarca actual... mi\\npadre, para más señas... atraviesa un momento\\r\\ndelicado.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_15",
      "hash64": "FD59175EBA6E24DE",
      "text": "Perdona. Un profesor que se precie no debería\\ncontarle sus penalidades a ningún alumno.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_03",
      "hash64": "919C69F04B41C8F8",
      "text": "No es ninguna molestia",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_04",
      "hash64": "919C70F04B41D4DD",
      "text": "No hay nada que perdonar",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_16",
      "hash64": "FD59165EBA6E232B",
      "text": "Tus palabras me reconfortan, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_17",
      "hash64": "FD59155EBA6E2178",
      "text": "Te lo agradezco de corazón.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_system_01",
      "hash64": "1BAB1A2334485759",
      "text": "¡Te has granjeado la confianza de Hesperio!",
      "flags": 0,
